Found by mcp-hub-worker during wave C (k185/k191/k187, 2026-11-10). Since k187 a changed server's new stdio child or forked worker starts only once the old one has exited (Hub::predecessors). A server that changes type over a reload (stdio/fork to docker, compose or http, or back) still overlaps for up to ~7 s; containers wait only on containers (%SETTLING). Decide whether every start_p waits on Hub::predecessors.

Maintainer-Entscheidung 2026-11-10: ja, jeder start_p wartet auf Hub::predecessors, auch bei einem Typwechsel über einen Reload (stdio/fork <-> docker/compose/http). Mit Test.
